WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.125
The AI for Aging Consortium.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:08.974
Many laboratories build AI for aging research, each with its own data and standards.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:15.552
The consortium is an open community of researchers who build AI and researchers who study aging.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.499
Together they set guidelines and build open resources.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.400
White papers carry the guidelines and the field's shared view.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:29.442
The aim is faster, more reliable research on aging and longevity.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.755
The work rests on seven pillars, from the community and its guidelines to the white papers.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.361
The first five white papers cover a roadmap, data standards, models, AI agents, and reporting and evaluation.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.425
Every contribution will be credited.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:56.373
Membership is free and opens in 2027. Researchers who build AI, researchers who study aging, and data holders are welcome.
